<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2c6c2c1ffb8347828f1d35f3dd2aac3cafdadbbfbe963f67211a09572c0f3b68_n0002/tu_0009> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "4 out of every 100 patients will have some bleeding. 2 out of every 100 patients will have a serious problem, such as damage to the lung, a heart attack, or a stroke. 1 out of every 100 patients will get an infection, which may require removing the ICD." .
<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_2c6c2c1ffb8347828f1d35f3dd2aac3cafdadbbfbe963f67211a09572c0f3b68_n0002/na_0004> <http://digistrucmed.org/relationConfidence> "0.95"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal> .
