<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2c6c2c1ffb8347828f1d35f3dd2aac3cafdadbbfbe963f67211a09572c0f3b68_n0002/tu_0011> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Having an ICD will not improve your symptoms or cure your heart problem." .
